[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the spark plug high tension leads.</p><p>2. Disconnect the coil supply electrical connectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Ignition &#x27;coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A30</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Undo the nuts (3a) and the fixing bolt (3b) and remove the support\ncomplete with coils (3c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2020934.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the support complete with coils tightening\nit using the fixing nuts and bolt.</p><p>Connect the coil supply electrical connectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Ignition &#x27;coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A30</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the high-tension leads to the spark\nplugs.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p>"]]